{
  "about": "kiosk-shared-phone §7.11.4 W-D5, W-D6, W-D7 and §7.11.6 rows W5-W7: the wrapper's one rule for every top-level navigation, as cases. Both apps' unit tests read this file (Android: tablet/android/core PolicyCasesTest; iOS only if the tablet is an iPad). `origin` is the build's own origin for these cases. `expect`: allow = load the URL; start = load the start page `<origin>/app/queue` instead; ignore = do nothing and never hand the URL to another app.",
